        "line": 14,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "# React Composition Patterns"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "Composition patterns for building flexible, maintainable React components. Avoid"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "boolean prop proliferation by using compound components, lifting state, and"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "composing internals. These patterns make codebases easier for both humans and AI"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "agents to work with as they scale."
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "## When to Apply"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "Reference these guidelines when:"
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "- Refactoring components with many boolean props"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "- Building reusable component libraries"
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "- Designing flexible component APIs"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "- Reviewing component architecture"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "- Working with compound components or context providers"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "## Rule Categories by Priority"
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "| Priority | Category                | Impact | Prefix          |"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "| -------- | ----------------------- | ------ | --------------- |"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "| 1        | Component Architecture  | HIGH   | `architecture-` |"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "| 2        | State Management        | MEDIUM | `state-`        |"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "| 3        | Implementation Patterns | MEDIUM | `patterns-`     |"
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "| 4        | React 19 APIs           | MEDIUM | `react19-`      |"
      },
