      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "## Quick Reference"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "### 1. Component Architecture (HIGH)"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "- `architecture-avoid-boolean-props` - Don't add boolean props to customize"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "  behavior; use composition"
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": "- `architecture-compound-components` - Structure complex components with shared"
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "  context"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": "### 2. State Management (MEDIUM)"
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": "- `state-decouple-implementation` - Provider is the only place that knows how"
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "  state is managed"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "- `state-context-interface` - Define generic interface with state, actions, meta"
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": "  for dependency injection"
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": "- `state-lift-state` - Move state into provider components for sibling access"
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "### 3. Implementation Patterns (MEDIUM)"
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "- `patterns-explicit-variants` - Create explicit variant components instead of"
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": "  boolean modes"
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": "- `patterns-children-over-render-props` - Use children for composition instead"
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": "  of renderX props"
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "### 4. React 19 APIs (MEDIUM)"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": "> **\u26a0\ufe0f React 19+ only.** Skip this section if using React 18 or earlier."
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "- `react19-no-forwardref` - Don't use `forwardRef`; use `use()` instead of `useContext()`"
